blkcp (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Promote memory-safe Rust 2021 Core & 16-Module Ratatui TUI to primary binaries (blkcp, blkcp-tui).
  * Retain hardened C11 & ncursesw reference implementation as blkcp-c and blkcp-tui-c.
  * Add in-flight BLAKE3 and Post-Quantum BLKS-384 checksumming with Multi-Ring io_uring Merkle Combiner.
  * Enforce ANSSI & Rust-2024 safety contract and C11 FORTIFY_SOURCE=3 / PIE / Full-RELRO hardening.

